---
import "../styles/global.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="A technical brewing workspace for professional breweries." />
    <title>For Professional Breweries — Demleme</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Demleme home">demleme<span>.</span></a>
      <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/homebrewers">Homebrewers</a><a href="/breweries">Breweries</a><a href="/#approach">Our approach</a></nav>
      <a class="header-cta" href="/#audience-paths">All brewing paths <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <details class="mobile-menu"><summary aria-label="Open navigation menu"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="/homebrewers">Homebrewers</a><a href="/breweries">Breweries</a><a href="/#approach">Our approach</a></nav></details>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="shell audience-page-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> FOR PROFESSIONAL BREWERIES</p>
        <h1>Consistency is built <em>batch by batch.</em></h1>
        <p>Give your brewing team a clearer way to work with recipe and batch information. Keep the technical details understandable and the process easier to review.</p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/#audience-paths">Explore Demleme <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
      <!-- IMAGE SLOT: BREWERIES-HERO | Replace placeholder with licensed documentary-style photo of a professional brewery floor or team. -->
      <section class="shell audience-hero">
        <div class="image-placeholder" data-image-slot="breweries-hero"><strong>IMAGE PLACEHOLDER · BREWERIES-HERO</strong><span>Professional brewing team, stainless vessels or a working production floor</span></div>
      </section>
      <section class="audience-page-section section-pad">
        <div class="shell audience-page-grid">
          <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> BUILT AROUND THE WORK</p><h2>Make production information easier to work with.</h2><p>Professional brewing depends on repeatable methods and shared understanding. Technical information should be clear to the people who use it, from planning through batch review.</p></div>
          <div><ul class="audience-page-list"><li>Keep recipe and batch information organised</li><li>Make calculations and units easier to interpret</li><li>Support more consistent review between batches</li></ul><p class="audience-page-note">A technical foundation for brewery teams — with claims kept to what the product can verify.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="closing-section section-pad"><div class="shell closing-inner"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> THE DETAILS MATTER</p><h2>Build a clearer view of <em>every batch.</em></h2><a class="button button-primary" href="/">Back to Demleme <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell footer-main"><a class="wordmark footer-wordmark" href="/">demleme<span>.</span></a><p>Technical brewing software for people who care about the details.</p><a class="back-top" href="/">Home ↑</a></div><div class="shell footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Demleme</span><span>Made for the craft of brewing.</span></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
